    "homeType": "SINGLE_FAMILY",
    "description": "With a prime location in the North Slope of Bernal Heights, this beautifully remodeled 2 bedroom 1 bathroom home is distinguished by its charming character, outdoor view deck & modern updates. Living room w/ bay windows & fireplace opens into the dining room, kitchen & deck, creating an ideal flow for entertaining indoors & out. Remodeled bright kitchen w/ quartz counters, ss appls, skylight, ample storage, breakfast area & convenient built-in desk. Sliding glass door leads out to a decorative plant wall & spacious deck perfect for al fresco dining & enjoying city skyline views. 2 well-sized bedrooms & remodeled tiled bath w/ shower over tub. Interior access to a large garage w/ 2 car parking, storage, laundry, sink & development potential. Classic details include picture rails, crisp wood trim & wood floors. Walk score of 96 near Precita & Bernal Parks & moments from shops & cafes on Cortland Avenue & Church Street, plus dining & nightlife along Valencia & Mission Streets. Easy commuting w/ nearby freeway access, BART, Muni & tech shuttles. With timeless appeal, modern style, a convenient location & exceptional outdoor living, this delightful home is a comfortable retreat for relaxing and entertaining, offering a prime opportunity to enjoy superlative city living."
  },
